  <section data-figma-id="271:80" class="d-831aa85b1">
    <p data-figma-id="275:130" class="d-5a9067f48">
      03 — VERSION 2
    </p>
    <h2 data-figma-id="275:131" class="d-b5d2c0db8">
      Then I built something that looked very intelligent and told me nothing.
    </h2>
    <p data-figma-id="275:132" class="d-839d7df68">
      For the second version I went full analyst. A market activity chart across twelve weeks. A
      donut showing what kind of signals were coming in. A watchlist with little status labels. Big
      numbers across the top: 28 competitors tracked, 1,284 sources scanned, 98% AI confidence.
    </p>
    <p data-figma-id="275:133" class="d-839d7df68">
      Honestly? It looked great. It looked like a product with a sales team.
    </p>
    <div data-figma-id="275:134" class="d-f46b3bfac">
      <div data-figma-id="276:136" class="d-53cd05d2f">
