          />
        </div>
        <div data-figma-id="272:73" class="d-5902df3f7">
          <p data-figma-id="272:75" class="d-a2feafe27">
            ADDING ONE
          </p>
          <p data-figma-id="272:76" class="d-414ecf017">
            Checkboxes, not a dropdown — so a company that moves into your layer can be recorded as
            doing exactly that.
          </p>
